  "sourceTitle": "Sausage Croquettes",
  "sourceText": "Sausage Croquettes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 1:10pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 pounds Sausage meat\n4 Eggs\n1 cup Butter\n1 cup Milk\nCracker or bread crumbs\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add powdered cracker or stale bread crumbs sufficient to thicken, while on the fire. Roll in oblong shapes and fry in lard. Roll the balls in cracker dust before frying. 2 Mrs. R. K. M.",
